<title>JAPAN: Nihon Unisys, Hewlett-Packard to join in UNIX sales.</title>
<headline>Nihon Unisys, Hewlett-Packard to join in UNIX sales.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nihon Unisys Ltd, a venture between Unisys Corp and Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd, said on Monday that it and Hewlett-Packard Japan Ltd had agreed to cooperate in sales and support for UNIX products.</p>
<p>Nihon Unisys said sales of these products would begin on September 2.</p>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Japan is owned by Hewlett-Packard Co and Yokogawa Electric Corp.</p>
</text>
